{"v":1,"segs":[{"s":0.76,"e":2.4,"src":"In the meeting just concluded,","ko":"방금 끝난 회의에서"},{"s":2.88,"e":5.68,"src":"the FOMC decided to raise the target range","ko":"FOMC는 기준금리"},{"s":5.74,"e":6.92,"src":"for the federal funds rate","ko":"목표 범위를"},{"s":7.48,"e":9.08,"src":"by a quarter of a percentage point","ko":"0.25%p 인상해"},{"s":9.6,"e":11.58,"src":"to three and three quarters to four percent","ko":"3.75~4%로 정했다"},{"s":12.22,"e":14.78,"src":"in support of the Federal Reserve's dual mandate.","ko":"이중 책무를 뒷받침한다"},{"s":14.98,"e":18.08,"src":"Economic activity is expanding at a solid pace.","ko":"경제는 견조한 확장세다"},{"s":18.92,"e":21.02,"src":"While uncertainty remains elevated,","ko":"불확실성은 여전히 높다"},{"s":21.58,"e":24.08,"src":"owing in part to geopolitical developments,","ko":"지정학적 요인 탓도 있다"},{"s":24.6,"e":26.84,"src":"domestic spending has been resilient.","ko":"내수 지출은 견조했다"},{"s":27.8,"e":29.62,"src":"Productivity growth, strong,","ko":"생산성 증가세는 강하다"},{"s":30.46,"e":32.56,"src":"and capital investment is robust.","ko":"자본 투자도 견조하다"},{"s":33.72,"e":36.0,"src":"Job gains have kept pace with the workforce,","ko":"고용은 노동력만큼 늘었다"},{"s":36.62,"e":38.96,"src":"and the unemployment rate has changed little.","ko":"실업률은 거의 그대로다"},{"s":40.12,"e":42.38,"src":"But inflation remains elevated.","ko":"다만 물가는 여전히 높다"},{"s":43.4,"e":44.9,"src":"Today's policy action","ko":"오늘의 정책 결정은"},{"s":44.94,"e":47.26,"src":"will support a timelier return","ko":"위원회 2% 목표 복귀를"},{"s":47.32,"e":48.82,"src":"to the committee's two percent goal.","ko":"앞당길 것이다"},{"s":49.12,"e":52.16,"src":"So the labor side of the Fed's congressional remit","ko":"연준 책무 중 고용 쪽은"},{"s":52.22,"e":53.08,"src":"is in good shape.","ko":"양호한 상태다"},{"s":54.38,"e":55.96,"src":"Yet for more than five years,","ko":"하지만 5년 넘게"},{"s":56.36,"e":58.66,"src":"inflation has been running above target.","ko":"물가는 목표를 웃돌았다"},{"s":59.76,"e":61.34,"src":"So our predominant focus is","ko":"우리의 최우선 초점은"},{"s":61.4,"e":64.2,"src":"on the price stability side of our mandate.","ko":"물가 안정 책무 쪽이다"},{"s":65.0,"e":69.08,"src":"The plain fact is that inflation is too high","ko":"분명히 물가가 너무 높다"},{"s":69.14,"e":70.56,"src":"and has been for too long.","ko":"그런 상태가 오래됐다"},{"s":70.9,"e":71.76,"src":"We believe that","ko":"우리 판단으로는"},{"s":71.82,"e":73.86,"src":"the unemployment rate is basically","ko":"실업률은 사실상"},{"s":73.96,"e":76.5,"src":"running consistent with full employment.","ko":"완전고용 수준이다"},{"s":77.16,"e":79.02,"src":"I don't believe that we need to do","ko":"목표 달성을 위해"},{"s":79.06,"e":80.62,"src":"harm to the labor markets","ko":"노동시장에 타격을 줄"},{"s":80.66,"e":81.98,"src":"to achieve our objective.","ko":"필요는 없다고 본다"},{"s":82.26,"e":82.96,"src":"I have to ask,","ko":"한 가지 여쭙겠습니다"},{"s":83.8,"e":84.94,"src":"what is your message here to","ko":"트럼프 대통령에게"},{"s":84.96,"e":85.56,"src":"President Trump,","ko":"하실 말씀은 뭡니까"},{"s":85.6,"e":87.64,"src":"who has repeatedly called to cut interest","ko":"그는 금리 인상이 아니라"},{"s":87.7,"e":88.66,"src":"rates, not raise them?","ko":"인하를 거듭 요구했는데요"},{"s":90.62,"e":92.2,"src":"I've got nothing for you","ko":"대통령과의 대화에 대해선"},{"s":92.64,"e":95.9,"src":"on a discussion with the president.","ko":"할 말이 없다"}]}